<description>&lt;p&gt;A drone attack on a Colombian military base in the north killed three soldiers and wounded between eight and sixteen, showing a rise in direct violence against the armed forces. Armed men entered a house in Toro and murdered three women, adding to civilian casualties. The conflict continues as a low-intensity asymmetric war involving the government, paramilitary groups, crime syndicates and far-left guerrillas. The UCDP recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. These incidents illustrate an escalation of both military and civilian targeting compared with earlier reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peace Brigades International-Canada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBGRFNxb1UtMkFtbVFDaVVkR0xFWnpWWXlkRENuREc1NmZHV0Vtb0gzS1Y3alE1OW8yaDlnVThzNHY4Q1cxY00temRUR2llY2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة سبأ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPNVpHX2ZiZ3FxR0VNSGN1QV9ORmxtbDR6Z2Y1U2k4QlVvcGRpMzU5aV9xVGQza2xLdllINDl1d2RjNzVCTjUzaWcwRU5iSmZVNVNFcUpfRFpqTDd5VXhicXNXRDFTX2dxczRmR0RhYnltbGlyNk1OMWZVNzYxOWFhQnhaY0xfekRES216VFNVVHFmWUU3Z1R6MDR5UzdmNzNm?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pajhwok Afghan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxObnc4YXRZWEI1T1lhREJQVjNZSElPY1NPNlFUWEUwSGcxbXRlMk12bkFmQzlBci1QdHJ